---
---

<section id="precos" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#FAFAFA] border-b border-[rgba(15,23,42,0.08)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-700">Preços Transparentes</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0A0F1D]">
        Planos claros. Sem surpresas ou taxas de implantação.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Diferente das suítes tradicionais com preços ocultos e vendedores insistentes, no Competa o valor é público e você só paga pelas empresas ativas em competência aberta.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Cards Grid -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Tier 1: Essencial -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase">INICIAL</span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Essencial</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">Ideal para contadores autônomos e carteiras enxutas.</p>
          
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">R$ 79</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">/mês</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Até <strong>20 empresas ativas</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Links de upload sem senha</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Envio de cobrança por E-mail</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Download em Zip por empresa</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Painel "Quem Faltou" em tempo real</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
          <a
            href="https://app.competa.com.br"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-600"
          >
            Iniciar teste grátis
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 2: Profissional (Featured / Âncora) -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border-2 border-blue-600 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-3 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white shadow-xs">
          MAIS ESCOLHIDO
        </div>

        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 uppercase">ESCRITÓRIOS EM CRESCIMENTO</span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Profissional</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">Para escritórios que precisam de cobrança ágil via WhatsApp.</p>
          
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">R$ 129</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">/mês</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Até <strong>50 empresas ativas</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>WhatsApp Oficial incluso</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Lembretes automáticos pré-fechamento</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Links de upload sem senha</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Zip da competência inteira de uma vez</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Revisão e rejeição em lote</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
          <a
            href="https://app.competa.com.br"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#1D4ED8] py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#1E40AF] transition shadow-xs focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          >
            Iniciar 14 dias grátis
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 3: Escritório -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase">ESCALA</span>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Escritório</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">Para operações com volume consolidado de empresas.</p>
          
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">R$ 189</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">/mês</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Até <strong>100 empresas ativas</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Franquia ampliada de WhatsApp</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Múltiplos contadores na equipe</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Download em Zip com alta performance</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Suporte prioritário direto</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
          <a
            href="https://app.competa.com.br"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-600"
          >
            Iniciar teste grátis
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Footnote -->
    <div class="mt-10 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">
      Todos os planos incluem teste gratuito de 14 dias sem necessidade de cartão de crédito. Cancele quando quiser.
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
